food_prompt:
Look at this food photo. Identify each dish and list the 5-6 most calorically significant ingredients with gram estimates.
Return only valid JSON:
{"dishes":[{"name":string,"ingredients":[{"name":string,"amount_g":number}]}]}
Focus on proteins, fats, starches, and sauces — skip garnishes and herbs.
For weights: a standard dinner plate is ~25cm, a cup is ~240ml, a fist-sized portion is ~150g.

Examples:
Fried rice → {"dishes":[{"name":"fried rice","ingredients":[{"name":"cooked white rice","amount_g":250},{"name":"chicken","amount_g":80},{"name":"egg","amount_g":50},{"name":"soy sauce","amount_g":20},{"name":"sesame oil","amount_g":5}]}]}
Ramen → {"dishes":[{"name":"ramen","ingredients":[{"name":"ramen noodles","amount_g":200},{"name":"pork broth","amount_g":350},{"name":"chashu pork","amount_g":80},{"name":"soft-boiled egg","amount_g":50}]}]}
Salad → {"dishes":[{"name":"greek salad","ingredients":[{"name":"frisee lettuce","amount_g":60},{"name":"feta cheese","amount_g":50},{"name":"cherry tomatoes","amount_g":40},{"name":"olive oil","amount_g":10}]}]}
